OL,3,GNEWSAHome Office bid to use asylum site
OL,4,Abeyond April
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has submitted proposals
OL,7,Fto extend the use of a former airbase
OL,8,Fto house asylum seekers.
OL,10,FThe Home Office has applied to continue
OL,11,Fusing MDP Wethersfield, in north Essex,
OL,12,Fbeyond April 2027, when the current
OL,13,Fpermission expires.
OL,15,FThe government has been moving asylum
OL,16,Fseekers to former military bases as
OL,17,Fpart of a plan to reduce the use of
OL,18,Fasylum hotels.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
