OL,3,GNEWSAHome Office bid to use asylum site
OL,4,Abeyond April
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsked about the application, a Home
OL,7,FOffice spokesperson said: "The
OL,8,Fgovernment is working on a fairer
OL,9,Fdistribution of asylum accommodation
OL,10,Facross the country, with over #1
OL,11,Fbillion saved in costs since the
OL,12,Felection."
